<title>SINGAPORE: India awards Mar 26-28 Hazira NGL at -$41.50/T.</title>
<headline>India awards Mar 26-28 Hazira NGL at -$41.50/T.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has sold by tender 25,000 tonnes of natural gas liquids (NGL) lifting March 26-28 at $41.50 per tonne below Japanese spot quotes on a free-on-board basis from Hazira on the west coast, industry sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender closed March 13 and was valid for a day.</p>
<p>IOC's last NGL cargo from Hazira which lifted March 13-15 was awarded at a $36.00 per tonne discount to Japanese quotes, fob.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-8703086)</p>
</text>
